Office
A modern open-plan office: bent backs from wall to wall and no privacy anywhere. Just how you used to like it when you were running these kinds of places. North seems to lead to some kind of meeting room. You can head back outside to the south.

A woman who you take to be the office manager is bustling wildly, juggling several administrative tasks at once.

A list of common passwords has been flimsily stuck up on the wall nearby.

