"See, that's another problem. Any time we stand up for ourselves, some spurious reason to fire them comes up. I've known three guys here who were getting support for unions, and they all got found out, and they all got fired immediately for, like, 'toxic influence' or something. They're busting unions. So it's just me protesting for now. I won't get anybody else in trouble."

[1] But haven't vampires done so much for us?
[2] Could you fix this water leak so I can get to the laboratory?
[3] I'm trying to break into Hadrian Alba's computer. Do you know what his password is?
