>3
"Exactly! Exactly! You feel it too!" Hade almost sounds genuinely happy.

"Look at us! We are vampires! We own this world! We're smarter than everyone, we're stronger than everyone, we've seen everything, we've, we have power. True power.

"But we can't use it! We're trapped by all these, these ridiculous weaknesses! We can't go anywhere without permission! We can't cross rivers! We can't eat garlic! We can't handle holy symbols! We can't have stakes driven through our hearts! We can't even go outside without some stupid umbrella or veil!

"The Moonlite is going to change that. The Moonlite is going to unshackle us.

"Well, again, not you. I'm going to kill you in a few minutes."

[1] How does the Moonlite make us more powerful?
