[4] You need to destroy this machine. It's too dangerous.

>1
"Yes," says Hade blankly. There's a small silence. "Well, they had to pull a couple hundred all-nighters to do it," he adds.

[1] Where are you getting the money to develop this thing?
[2] Sounds like a cool machine. Be a shame if someone took it for themselves.
